Port 22
HostKey /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PasswordAuthentication no
KbdInteractiveAuthentication no
PubkeyAuthentication yes
UsePAM no
AuthorizedKeysFile /etc/ssh/authorized/%u
LogLevel VERBOSE
PerSourcePenalties no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp

Match User agent
    ChrootDirectory /srv/repo
    ForceCommand internal-sftp -l VERBOSE -P remove,rmdir,rename,posix-rename,setstat,fsetstat,lsetstat,symlink,copy-data,mkdir -u 0222
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no

Match User nolink
    ChrootDirectory /srv/repo
    ForceCommand internal-sftp -l VERBOSE -P remove,rmdir,rename,posix-rename,setstat,fsetstat,lsetstat,symlink,copy-data,hardlink,mkdir -u 0222
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no

Match User srv
    ChrootDirectory /srv/repo
    ForceCommand internal-sftp -l VERBOSE
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no

Match User wide
    ChrootDirectory /srv/repo
    ForceCommand internal-sftp -l VERBOSE -u 0222
    AllowTcpForwarding no
    X11Forwarding no
